de get/put as API and optionally mapping dunder methods. But if __getitem__ should move to end? It's a cache, likely yes? Need be careful: If user uses [] to get, it is a use and should refresh recency. If __contains__ shouldn't refresh. __del__? maybe not needed.\n\nCould include complete class with mapping interface:\nclass LRUCache(Mutable",
